<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/styler.css">
</head>
<body class="centered-bg">
	<nav>
		<a href="/">Home</a>
		<a href="/picgen">Pic Generator</a>
	</nav>
	<div class="head">
		<h1>JokeHub</h1>
		<div class="imgblock">
			<img src="../resources/images/JokeHub/CNetwork_Figures_Laughint_At_Buggsy.jpg" alt="Cartoon Network figures roasting Bugs Bunny"  Logo" class="logo">
			<img src="../resources/images/JokeHub/ChuckLaughs.jpg" alt="Chuck Norris laughing at his own jokes, not roasts" class="logo">		
		</div>
	</div>
    <div class="start">

        <p><%= description %></p>
    </div>


    <div id="jokeContainer" style="width: fit-content;">
        <button class="djbutton">GET Dad Joke</button>
        <h2 style="align-self: center;">DaD Joke(s):</h2>

        <ul id="jokes"></ul>

    </div>

    <div class="chuck-norris-jokes">
        <div id="jokeContainer">
        <button class="chuckNorrisBtn">GET Chuck Norris Joke</button>
            <h2>Chuck Joke(s):</h2>
            <ul id="chuckNorrisJoke"></ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="end">
        <p>Thanks for visiting JokeHub! Hope you had a laugh or two. Come back soon for more jokes and fun!</p>
    </div>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/axios/dist/axios.min.js"></script>
<script src="/scripts/app.js"></script>

<footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-main">
        <p>&copy; 2025 JokeHub. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-info">
        <p>Additional information on request.</p>
        <p>Contact us at: info@jokehub.com</p>
        <p>Follow us on social media!</p>
    </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>